OL,3,GNEWSA'Time and money wasted' as police 
OL,4,Asent to court without testifying       
OL,6,FLarge numbers of witnesses required to 
OL,7,Fattend court are not called to give    
OL,8,Fevidence - including police officers   
OL,9,Fwho have been pulled from front-line   
OL,10,Fduty, a report has found.              
OL,12,FCriminal Justice Inspection Northern   
OL,13,FIreland (CJI) said the reasons included
OL,14,Flast-minute guilty pleas by defendants.
OL,16,FIt said evidence "pointed to           
OL,17,Fsubstantial levels of wasted time and  
OL,18,Fcosts to the public purse".            
